{"id":602,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教を土台に育む思考と協働","feature_description":"金城学院は、聖書に基づくキリスト教教育を基盤に、人間の尊厳を大切にしながら、社会に主体的に参画する女性の育成を目指します。教科の学びと多様な教育活動を通じて、疑問から課題を立てて解決する科学的思考、自分の言葉で伝える表現、対話して目標を形にする協働の三つの力を育成します。中高六年の学びを通じ、他者を尊重し未来を描いて行動する力を培います。","clubs":[{"id":11406,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11407,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11408,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11409,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11410,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11411,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11412,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11413,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11414,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11415,"name":"イラスト研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11416,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11417,"name":"ハープアンサンブル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11418,"name":"ハンドベルクワイア","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.kinjo-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11419,"name":"美術部","c